  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b59e5109641be024fb790db23ec12cf0, type: 3}
  m_Name: PeterQ3
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sentences:
  - text: "Quel \xE9tait l'objet de cette interview ? "
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 10e726bdc8934bb42b9ea78a54dd1aa3, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    contactToRemove: {fileID: 0}
    evidence: {fileID: 0}
    inspectorSceneToCollect: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
  - text: "Elle souhaitait r\xE9diger un article sur l\u2019histoire de la famille
      Warner et sur mon parcours, naturellement. "
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 80fc6151c1a269d4fbe227d2353da448, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    contactToRemove: {fileID: 0}
    evidence: {fileID: 0}
    inspectorSceneToCollect: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
  - text: "Comme nous d\xE9tenons l\u2019entreprise Diageo qui est tr\xE8s c\xE9l\xE8bre
      pour sa fabrication de vins, bi\xE8res et spiritueux, il n\u2019y avait de
      meilleur sujet."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1882c8f5fd824fb42a890614c3da354f, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    contactToRemove: {fileID: 0}
    evidence: {fileID: 0}
    inspectorSceneToCollect: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
  - text: "Je supervise personnellement la branche d\xE9di\xE9e aux spiritueux, notamment
      le gin Gordon\u2019s, fort appr\xE9ci\xE9 dans tout le pays. Difficile de trouver
      un meilleur exemple de tradition et de r\xE9ussite\u202F! "
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1882c8f5fd824fb42a890614c3da354f, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 25872399edc81c14ba5c82707cb911ce, type: 2}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    contactToRemove: {fileID: 0}
    evidence: {fileID: 0}
    inspectorSceneToCollect: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
  background: {fileID: 0}
  nextScene: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c5f6c13105d7be64ebdfcd4663bc496e, type: 2}
